    "text": "Let f (n) be the number of isomorphism classes of finite groups of order n.\nIs it true that the equation f (n) = k has a solution for any positive integer k? The\nanswer is affirmative for all k ⩽ 1000 (G. M. Wei, Southeast Asian Bull. Math., 22,\nno. 1 (1998), 93–102).                                                        W. J. Shi",
